---
/** /wip/ demo: a hinted word and a hinted chip. */
---
<div class="card card--compact"><div class="demo-row">
  <span class="hint" tabindex="0" data-hint="Visits that left after one page, as a share of all visits. Lower is better.">Bounce rate</span>
  <span class="status-chip status-chip--warning hint" tabindex="0" data-hint="Two of nine goals are behind schedule.">At risk</span>
  <span class="hint" tabindex="0" data-hint="Aligned to its end, for a hint near the window's right edge." data-align="end">End-aligned</span>
</div></div>
<p class="muted">Rest the pointer on one (it waits 0.3s) or tab to it (at once).</p>
